    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Hotel Overloop</h2><strong><br><i>1 corridor, 2 elevators, 8 floors, 50+ anomalies.</i></strong><br><br>Explore the enigmatic Hotel Overloop, where each floor repeats the same eerie corridor. Your goal is simple: navigate through this deceptive simplicity and escape the loop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955200/extras/f14bd66b25201857f0da52771e9344d6.poster.avif?t=1716886122\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955200/extras/f14bd66b25201857f0da52771e9344d6.webm?t=1716886122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955200/extras/f14bd66b25201857f0da52771e9344d6.mp4?t=1716886122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Mission:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    <strong>Detect the Unusual:</strong> See something strange? Return to the elevator you came from to avoid worsening your situation.<br></li><li>    <strong>Proceed with Caution:</strong> If everything looks normal, move on to the next elevator. But remember, not all is as it seems.<br></li><li>    <strong>Escape:</strong> Outsmart the hotel's tricks to find your way out.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    <strong>Mysterious Anomalies:</strong> Keep an eye on subtle changes; they're your clues to advance or signs to retreat.<br></li><li>    <strong>Atmospheric Tension:</strong> The hotel\u2019s consistent setting is designed to amplify suspense, making each moment in the corridor a tense experience.<br></li><li>    <strong>Simple Yet Challenging:</strong> The game\u2019s rules are straightforward, but mastering them will test your alertness and strategic thinking.<br></li><li>    <strong>Play Time:</strong> Each session can last from 15 to 60 minutes, perfect for quick plays or extended explorations.</li></ul><br>Step into Hotel Overloop, where each corridor could lead to escape or return you to the beginning.",
